{% assign featured = settings.featured_product | default: all_products['mystic-clouds'] %}
<section class="section-pad drop-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE CURRENT DROP</span><h2>A small run.<br><em>A big personality.</em></h2></div><p>Find your theme. Make it your everyday.</p></div><div class="drop-card"><a href="{{ featured.url | default: routes.all_products_collection_url }}" class="drop-image">{% render 'product-image', image: featured.featured_image %}</a><div class="drop-copy"><span class="drop-label">{{ section.settings.label | escape }}</span><h3>{{ featured.title | default: 'Mystic Clouds' | escape }}</h3><p>Cloud-inspired color. Soft combed cotton. A little extra character from the ground up.</p>{% if featured != blank %}<div class="drop-price">{{ featured.price | money }}</div>{% render 'stock-note', variant: featured.selected_or_first_available_variant %}{% endif %}<a class="button navy" href="{{ featured.url | default: routes.all_products_collection_url }}">{% if featured != blank and featured.available == false %}Explore the drop{% else %}Shop this drop{% endif %} {% render 'arrow' %}</a>{% render 'shop-trust' %}</div></div></section>
{% schema %}{"name":"Featured drop","settings":[{"type":"text","id":"label","label":"Drop label","default":"MYSTIC CLOUDS / COLLECTION 001"}],"presets":[{"name":"Featured drop"}]}{% endschema %}
